# J4G Inventory UI / UX

**Admin list pages:** follow [shopify-admin-ui.mdc](shopify-admin-ui.mdc) for shell, density, tables, and components.

Modern operational SaaS — compact, clean, scannable, neutral. Not a typical Laravel CRUD dashboard.

## Design goal

Feel like Shopify Admin / Stripe / GitHub / Linear:

- table-first, desktop-optimized, responsive on tablet/mobile
- compact spacing, small readable text, thin borders, subtle hovers
- not colorful, not flashy, not marketing-style

## Colors

- Background: `gray-50` / `neutral-50`
- Panel: `white`
- Border: `gray-200`
- Text: `gray-900`, muted `gray-500`
- Primary: `slate-900`
- Status: green (ok/active), amber (low), red (danger/out), blue (reserved), gray (inactive)

Avoid gradients, neon, rainbow dashboards.

## Layout

- Fixed `w-60` light sidebar + slim `h-12` top nav + full-width content
- No centered `max-w-7xl` content — use full available width
- Mobile: hidden sidebar (slide-over), horizontal scroll tables, scrollable modals, `h-10` tap targets

## Typography

Inter via Bunny Fonts. Base `text-[13px]`.

| Element | Size |
|---------|------|
| Page title | `text-xl font-semibold` |
| Table / body | `text-[13px]` |
| Table header | `text-[12px]` |
| Labels | `text-xs font-medium` |
| Badges | `text-[11px]` |

## Density

- Table cells: `px-3 py-2`, rows ~40–44px
- Stat cards: `p-4`, value `text-xl`
- Panel headers: `px-4 py-3`

## Components (prefer `<x-ui.*>`)

`page-header`, `page-card`, `async-table`, `button`, `badge`, `status-pill`, `stat-card`, `empty-state`, form inputs

CSS utilities: `ui-table`, `ui-toolbar-form`, `ui-row-action`, `ui-row-more`, `ui-modal-*`

## Empty & loading states

- Never blank pages — compact empty state inside panel
- AJAX: disable submit, "Saving…" label, toast on result

## Final rule

Every screen answers: what is happening, what needs attention, what action to take — dense, calm, fast.
